thinking-orbs: dotted thought-orb loading indicators
Made by Jakub Antalik (github.com/Jakubantalik/thinking-orbs, https://orbs.jakubantalik.com)

RasanAI uses material from thinking-orbs (v0.3.1) under the MIT License
(see LICENSE in this folder): the geometry of the nine orb states, the tuned
presets for the two sizes (64 and 20) and a subset of the golden vectors.

runtime/rasan-orbs.js is a port of that material from TypeScript to vanilla
JavaScript and is marked in its header comment. It was modified by RasanAI: the
library's requestAnimationFrame / performance.now clock is replaced by the
scene's paused-timeline time (so every frame is a pure function of that time),
and a state-change dissolve, a brand-colour ink and a hero size are added.
The MIT copyright notice and permission notice are kept in LICENSE.

The rest of RasanAI stays under its own licence (MIT, see the root LICENSE).

Not copied: the React component, the React Native and SwiftUI ports, the demo
site and the library's header image.
